    "admin.shield_activity_row_expand": "Show the evidence for this row",
    "admin.shield_activity_sampled": "While a filter is on, the figures are counted over the most recent {n} rows rather than the whole period — so treat them as \"at least\".",
    "admin.shield_activity_score_hint_short": "personal data leaving Europe counts double",
    "admin.shield_activity_stops_at": "stops at {n}",
    "admin.shield_activity_tools_note": "from a connected app, not an AI model. “EU-hosted AI only” changes nothing here; the tool columns in the matrix do.",
    "admin.shield_activity_tools_note_lead": "Most of this is tool traffic",
    "admin.shield_activity_trend_hint": "click a bar to filter on that period",
    "admin.shield_allow_terms_summary": "Exact, in EVERY category, permanently: “Shell” does not allow “Shell Advies BV”.",
    "admin.shield_allow_terms_title": "Never hide these — {n} exceptions",
    "admin.shield_allow_terms_title_public": "Never hide these — {n} exceptions + 221 well-known companies",
    "admin.shield_compliance_attention": "needs attention",
    "admin.shield_compliance_desc": "Saving here re-runs two checks in the Compliance Center straight away. This screen and that one are two windows on one fact.",
    "admin.shield_compliance_dlp_ok": "Data-loss prevention active",
    "admin.shield_compliance_dlp_partial": "Data-loss prevention only partly active",
    "admin.shield_hiw_also_title": "Three more things worth knowing",
    "admin.shield_hiw_detect_body": "The text is scanned for the kinds of personal data you ticked. A kind you did NOT tick is never asked of the model, so it can never be found — which is why a shield that is on with nothing ticked finds nothing at all.",
    "admin.shield_hiw_dial_body": "It is a confidence threshold, so a LOWER percentage finds MORE. That is why the levels are named rather than numbered, and why the slider says “finds more” and “finds less” instead of 10% and 100%. Balanced is the setting every published quality figure was measured at.",
    "admin.shield_hiw_dial_title": "The strictness dial runs backwards",
    "admin.shield_hiw_exceptions_title": "Two lists work the opposite way round",
    "admin.shield_hiw_guard": "The scanning itself is done by a separate service on your own infrastructure (the PII Guard). If it is ever stopped or unreachable, the categories on this page find nothing until it is back — the header says so when that happens — while your own words and patterns keep working, because they need no model.",
    "admin.shield_hiw_guard_down": "Right now the detection service is not answering, so no personal data is being FOUND — every category on this page is inactive until it is back. Your own words and patterns still work; they need no model. A platform administrator installs and restarts it.",
    "admin.shield_hiw_in_body": "A chat, an agent, or — if you leave “Also protect routines” on — a routine running overnight with nobody watching.",
    "admin.shield_hiw_in_title": "Someone sends a message",
    "admin.shield_hiw_open_activity": "Open the evidence",
    "admin.shield_hiw_open_detection": "Open the matrix",
    "admin.shield_hiw_open_outbound": "Open the two checks",
    "admin.shield_hiw_open_processing": "Open the two checks",
    "admin.shield_hiw_out_body": "And everything that happened on the way is recorded — who, what was found, what was done about it, and where any outgoing call went.",
    "admin.shield_hiw_out_title": "The AI answers",
    "admin.shield_hiw_outbound_body": "Only if the model runs OUTSIDE your organisation: one more look, which can pause and let the person decide. This is also where you say which kinds a connected app may never carry out — Gmail, Drive, a web search.",
    "admin.shield_hiw_own_server": "All of this runs on your own server. A message is read and stripped BEFORE it goes anywhere, and nothing is sent elsewhere in order to check it.",
    "admin.shield_hiw_precedence_body": "Before any rules set on an individual agent. An agent can be stricter, never looser — if the two disagree, the stricter one wins.",
    "admin.shield_hiw_precedence_title": "These rules run first",
    "admin.shield_hiw_process_body": "Whatever was found is either replaced with placeholders — the AI sees [email_1], never the address, and Bee Flow puts the real value back in the answer — or the message is stopped and the person is asked to rewrite it. This gate closes on EVERY message.",
    "admin.shield_hiw_subtitle": "What happens to a message, in the order it happens, and which of these panes decides what.",
    "admin.shield_hiw_title": "How the Privacy Shield works",
    "admin.shield_hiw_two_checks": "Step 2 is the gate that always closes; step 3 is one extra look, only before a model outside your organisation, and the only place an employee gets a say. Setting step 2 to “Do not send the message” does not produce the Ask dialog — that is step 3 on “Ask”.",
    "admin.shield_hiw_two_checks_lead": "Steps 1 and 2 are not alternatives.",
    "admin.shield_clamp_action": "Replace with placeholders — messages are stopped instead",
    "admin.shield_clamp_web_guard": "Protect web searches — switched back off",
    "admin.shield_clamp_web_guard_cats": "the kinds withheld from web searches — emptied",
    "admin.shield_clamp_tool_policy": "the kinds withheld from tools outside your organisation — emptied",
    "admin.shield_clamp_other": "{n} other settings",
    "admin.shield_clamp_lead": "Saved, with notes. Your plan does not include: {what}. Every other change did land.",
    "admin.shield_clamp_generic": "Saved. Some settings were adjusted to your plan limits.",
    "admin.shield_clamp_load": "Your plan does not include: {what}. What you see here is what is in force.",
    "admin.shield_clamp_load_generic": "Some settings are limited by your current plan.",
    "admin.shield_terms_rejected": "Saved, with notes. {n} of your own words or patterns were refused and are NOT in force — the offending rows are marked below.",
    "admin.shield_compliance_ok": "in order",
    "admin.shield_activity_country_unknown": "Unknown",
    "admin.shield_compliance_logging": "Logging & monitoring",
    "admin.shield_compliance_title": "Touches Compliance",
    "admin.shield_disabled_note_steps": "Protection is off for this organisation. Messages go to the AI unchanged, and the other steps stay inactive until you turn it on.",
    "admin.shield_discard": "Discard",
    "admin.shield_enable_desc_strong": "Applies to every chat and every agent in this organisation. Off means nothing is checked, at all.",
    "admin.shield_eu_models_only": "This covers MODELS only — connected apps such as Gmail or Drive are not affected by it.",
    "admin.shield_eu_models_use_matrix": "Hold those back with the tool columns in the matrix.",
