    "compliance.check_aia_art50_marking_desc": "Documents a routine generates from model output carry a visible \"Generated with AI\" line and machine-readable metadata (PDF Info / Word properties) stating they are AI-generated, by which provider, when and from which routine — EU AI Act Art. 50(2). Required from 2 Dec 2026.",
    "compliance.check_aia_art50_marking_fix": "Switch on AI content marking under Compliance → Settings. Every document generated downstream of an AI step then gets the visible footer and the metadata automatically; you can override the footer text per organisation. This marks the file itself — full C2PA content credentials (signed provenance manifests) are out of scope.",
