    "routines.node.slide.desc": "One slide of a presentation: a title with bullet points, a table, a quote or an image",
    "routines.node.slide.help": "Builds one slide as a value — no file yet. Give it a title and some content (bullets, a paragraph, a table, a quote), optionally speaker notes, and bind them to earlier steps. Use \"one per item\" to make a slide for every row of a list, then feed the slides to a Presentation step. Visuals: a chart from data rows, KPI tiles, a timeline of steps, or an accent-coloured emphasis slide.",
